              "code_content": "# Analytical two-stage crashworthiness screening model.\n# Refit constants and equations to correlated test or OpenRadioss data.\nvehicle_mass_kg = 2000.0\nstage_1_stroke_m = 0.3\nstage_2_stroke_m = 0.3\nimpact_speed_mps = 15.6\n\ninitial_kinetic_energy = 0.5 * vehicle_mass_kg * impact_speed_mps**2\nabsorbed_energy = (\n    stage_1_force * stage_1_stroke_m\n    + stage_2_force * stage_2_stroke_m\n)\nresidual_energy = initial_kinetic_energy - absorbed_energy\npeak_acceleration = stage_2_force / vehicle_mass_kg\nforce_order_margin = stage_1_force - stage_2_force"
